er the art of <strong>shipbuilding </strong>and construct a variety of vessels from fishing or cargo boats up to longships and the legendary drakkar. <strong>Take to the seas</strong> and sail to other islands, where you might find not only rare resources that will give you and your people an edge, but also other villagers eager to join your cause.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2753930/extras/c613f92a441bb6a146c73e9eae3f3d1a.webp?t=1788251718\" width=616 height=41 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Establish a settlement</strong> and enhance it with a variety of buildings like <strong>workshops</strong>, <strong>smithy </strong>or <strong>carpenter</strong>, your fellow settlers follow your commands as a <strong>Jarl</strong>, the undisputed leader of the viking community and protector of your people. Assign them to jobs like <strong>farming</strong>, <strong>hunting </strong>or <strong>fishing </strong>to feed the villagers or let them gather resources so your village can grow and the communities’ needs are fulfilled.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2753930/extras/cb78bfd7764cd849db63c7f4090d1e06.webp?t=1788251718\" width=616 height=41 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The world of Vikings Dynasty is rich in <strong>lore </strong>and references to <strong>Norse mythology</strong> and their gods. Apply runes to your items and boost your equipment. Or make an offering to the Gods and be rewarded with their blessing for you and your people.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared